From e68f379f02a451bc89d2bf68e97da89fb0671247 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:34:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/9] Access 9.2 A-3: POST /npc_frustration and the frustration
 held on the server

The NpcFrustration concern checks each report in order (the NPC known, can
fail and every cause and object its own, a cause holds on the server, the pace
floor), raises or eases the level and answers with the tell and settled.
GET /scenario carries npcFrustration with each need's hold; a door unlock or a
room load records metAt for an NPC that can fail. Folds in review R5 n1 (an
owned-cause fail after an off-only fail is held to the use floor) and n5 (no
ease at the own station while a cause the server owns holds there).
